Package: omniaci
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: OmniaSolutions <matteo.boscolo@omniasolutions.eu>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-venv, ca-certificates, git, adduser, init-system-helpers
Recommends: sudo, postgresql-client
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: web service to deploy and test Odoo instances
 OmniaCI manages the production and test instances of Odoo servers from a
 web interface: git pull, module update and restart, database backup, merge
 of the tested code into production, automatic update from git and a live
 view of the Odoo log.
 .
 The Python dependencies are installed at configure time in
 /opt/omniaci/venv, from PyPI, at the versions locked for its Python: the
 system python3 when it is 3.10 or newer, otherwise a local python3.10+,
 otherwise a Python 3.12 downloaded into /opt/omniaci/python.
